"Up to 20 text clips and links are saved on this Mac, including across restarts. Older clips are removed automatically." = "在這部 Mac 儲存最多 20 筆文字與連結，重新啟動後仍會保留。最舊的記錄會自動移除。";
"Clips marked as concealed or temporary by the source app are ignored. Other sensitive text can still be saved; pause recording when needed." = "來源 App 標記為隱藏或暫存的內容不會記錄。其他敏感文字仍可能被儲存，請視需要暫停記錄。";
"Choose a clip to copy it, then press ⌘V in your app to paste." = "選取一筆記錄即可複製，再回到 App 中按 ⌘V 貼上。";
"Retry Clipboard Access" = "重試剪貼板存取";
"Your clipboard stays yours" = "你的剪貼板，由你掌控";
"ClipNest 1.0 · Free & open source" = "ClipNest 1.0 · 免費開源";
"Quit ClipNest" = "結束 ClipNest";
